  "fail_closed_rules": [
    "Every generated lane must emit rows for L2, X2, X1D, X3, and L6.",
    "Product-visible L2 requires a signed packet, frozen room, validation gates, attempt, seal, and content-addressed bundle.",
    "Section compatibility mirrors must reference the canonical L2 receipt bundle and cannot self-certify.",
    "Missing lane artifacts are required ScorecardRow failures, not omissions.",
    "Per-lane X3 is audited as product evidence; apps_eval never overwrites apps_rg X3.",
    "UNKNOWN and NOT_RUN are never passing verdicts for required lane microsteps.",
    "Mock, stub, or provider-free output is never product ALLOW evidence."
  ]
